SUMMARY:WiCyS San Diego Affiliate | AI Under Scrutiny: Perspectives from Banking\, Higher Ed\, and Engineering
DESCRIPTION:<p>Everyone is talking about AI. Join WiCyS San Diego for an honest discussion about what it looks like to use it and evaluate it from a security or compliance perspective. Environments where decisions have to hold up to audit\, data sensitivity\, and teams or customers that may not trust the tools yet. Three cybersecurity professionals […]</p>\\n | Source: WiCyS Events | Tags: compliance\, cyber\, cybersecurity\, security | https://www.wicys.org/event/wicys-san-diego-affiliate-ai-under-scrutiny-perspectives-from-banking-higher-ed-and-engineering/
