DTSTAMP:20260824T160006Z
DTSTART:20260830T140000Z
DTEND:20260830T160000Z
SUMMARY:Laser Cutter Safety Training
DESCRIPTION:Noisebridge Hackerspace Learn how to be safe while using the laser cutter! We have a 150W\, CO2 laser cutter with a 3 x 4 ft bed. This training is required to use the laser cutter because we don't want people setting our most expensive equipment donation on fire. You have to do this training even if you were trained at the old space\, as we have different safety features now. Training covers * Dangers of the laser cutter * How to be safe * How to put out a fire Each participant will cut a piece of cardboard on the laser cutter while following all the safety steps. This is also a good place to ask questions about specific materials or projects. There is a 5$ fee to register\, and we suggest a 20-30$ donation for this class: https://donate.noisebridge.net. If the registration fee is a barrier to your participation\, please reach out to the event organisers. | Source: DC415 San Francisco | Tags: security | https://www.meetup.com/noisebridge/events/316064419/
LOCATION:
URL:https://www.meetup.com/noisebridge/events/316064419/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ebebeeb61e35e14f@zcyber-gtm.local
DTSTAMP:20260824T160006Z
DTSTART:20260830T230000Z
DTEND:20260831T020000Z
SUMMARY:Opsin at Ravinia | Dinner & Picnic with Miranda Lambert
DESCRIPTION:<b>Address:</b><br>Ravinia Festival<br>Highland Park\, IL<br>United States<br><br><b>What Is It?</b><br>Trade the SOC for the lawn. Join Opsin for cocktails and a picnic dinner under the stars at Ravinia\, then settle in for Miranda Lambert live. A relaxed night with fellow Chicagoland CISOs to close out the summer right. <br><br>We invite attendees to also <b>bring a</b> <b>plus one</b> so bring a significant other\, your son/daughter\, a friend\, or a colleague!<br><br><b>Ideal For</b> <br><br>Cybersecurity Executives/Leaders looking to have a great time\, network with peers\, and who are trying to navigate AI governance by exchanging notes\, ideas\, and best practices.<br><br>Space is limited and all registrations require approval. <br><br>Register on Luma page above!<br><br>Please contact Patrick Lee at <a href="mailto:patrick@opsinsecurity.com" target="_blank">patrick@opsinsecurity.com</a> if you have any questions | Source: Chicago InfoSec Events Calendar | Tags: ciso\, cyber\, cybersecurity\, infosec\, security | https://calendar.google.com/calendar/ical/ChicagoInfoSecEvents@gmail.com/public/basic.ics
LOCATION:https://luma.com/vry63fll
URL:https://calendar.google.com/calendar/ical/ChicagoInfoSecEvents@gmail.com/public/basic.ics
END:VEVENT
