SUMMARY:BurbSec East - Sponsored by Aikido!!
DESCRIPTION:BurbSec Chicago: The Midwest's Favorite Cybersecurity Events This month's sponsor is [AIKIDO!!](https://www.aikido.dev/) 🚀🔐 **Unlock the Excitement at Burbsec!** 🍻🎉 Are you ready for a night of geeking out\, making new friends\, and expanding your network in the world of infosec? Look no further—Burbsec East is the place to be\, and everyone is welcome! We have **NO DUES\, NO PRESENTATIONS\, and NO PUSHY SALESPEOPLE OR RECRUITERS!** 👥 **A Community Just Like You:** We're just like you\, and you'll fit right in! Whether you're passionate about infosec\, love indulging in memes\, enjoy a good beer\, or appreciate compliance jokes (among other things)\, we've got you covered. Our diverse skill set ranges from novice to expert\, and yes\, we even dabble in paper hat making! 🎩✨ 🤝 **Connections That Matter:** At Burbsec East\, you'll find more than just like-minded people. You'll make valuable contacts\, form genuine friendships\, and expand your network of professional connections. These are the kinds of connections that come in handy when you're tackling that thorny problem at work\, at home\, or in the job market. 💡 **Knowledge Exchange:** Whether you're seeking answers to tough questions or ready to share your expertise\, there's always someone at Burbsec East who's got your back. We thrive in a collaborative atmosphere where knowledge flows freely\, and camaraderie is key. This month's sponsor is [AIKIDO!!](https://www.aikido.dev/) 🕕 **Flexible Timing:** Don't worry about being fashionably late! People will start rolling in after work around 6 pm\, and we keep the vibe going until we're done (generally 4-6 hours) 🌐 **Stay Connected:** Don't miss out on the latest updates and community banter! Join the BurbSec Discord and follow us on Twitter for all the behind-the-scenes action and event sneak peeks. **Information Superhighway World Wide Web Presence:** Discord: [(](%5D(https%3A//discord.gg/zfkTdnTf)%5Bhttps://discord.gg/4hhVPHebJX%5D(https://discord.gg/4hhVPHebJX)%5B)](https://discord.gg/zfkTdnTf) Web: ([http://burbsec.com/](http://burbsec.com/)) Twitter: [@burbseceast](https://www.x.com/burbseceast) BlueSky:[ @east.burbsec.com](https://bsky.app/profile/east.burbsec.com)d | Source: BurbSec Chicago | Tags: compliance\, cyber\, cybersecurity\, infosec\, security | https://www.meetup.com/burbsec/events/314595012/
LOCATION:
URL:https://www.meetup.com/burbsec/events/314595012/
END:VEVENT
